### Handy test requests. Works in VS Code (REST Client extension) and IntelliJ.

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:9080/api/tasks

### Only finished tasks
GET http://localhost:9080/api/tasks?status=DONE

### Get one task
GET http://localhost:9080/api/tasks/1

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:9080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Write README", "description": "Explain how to run the app" }

### Update a task
PUT http://localhost:9080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Install WebSphere Liberty", "description": "Done!", "status": "DONE" }

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:9080/api/tasks/2

### Validation error (empty title -> 400)
POST http://localhost:9080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### Health
GET http://localhost:9080/health
